<title>NETHERLANDS: VASTNED RETAIL FIRST QTR NET PROFIT UP.</title>
<headline>VASTNED RETAIL FIRST QTR NET PROFIT UP.</headline>
<dateline>ROTTERDAM 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>First quarter 1997</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>Direct investment result (net profit)  15.5  vs  14.7</p>
<p>    ditto per share (guilders)		  2.01 vs   1.97</p>
<p>    Investment portfolio (billion)	    1.32 vs   1.33*</p>
<p>    Group equity				  879    vs 864*</p>
<p>* NOTE - comparisons for investment portfolio and group</p>
<p>equity as per end-1996.</p>
<p>NOTE - Property investment group VastNed Retail NV said it</p>
<p>reiterated its forecast that the 1997 full-year net profit per</p>
<p>share would at least equal 1996's 8.08 guilders.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
